---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Add Your Skill" description="Learn how to add your skill or agent to the Nava Skills Registry.">

  <div class="mb-8">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 m-0">Add Your Skill to the Registry</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1 m-0">The registry auto-scans all navapbc repos every 4 hours. No manual submission needed — just add the right files.</p>
    <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-plum-50 border border-plum-200 rounded-lg">
      <div class="flex-1">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-plum-900 m-0">Not a GitHub user?</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-plum-700 mt-0.5 m-0">Submit via Google Form. The ops team reviews within 1 business day.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdW3RSdwVvbFDFz_OBdZ1CzyNq_pYq_z8zsR0NdOknRApcR6A/viewform?usp=preview" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="flex-shrink-0 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium bg-plum-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-plum-700 transition-colors no-underline">
        Submit a skill →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Concepts -->
  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-4">Plugins vs. Skills vs. Agents</h2>

    <!-- Metaphor cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
      <div class="p-4 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="text-lg">📚</span>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 m-0">Plugin — the Cookbook</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed m-0">A packaging mechanism — your GitHub repo — that bundles skills, agents, and API connections for your team or the community to install together.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="text-lg">🍳</span>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 m-0">Skill — the Recipe</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed m-0">Auto-loaded instructions that give Claude a specific, repeatable capability (e.g., summarising a README, formatting a codebase) without leaving your current thread.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="text-lg">⚙️</span>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 m-0">Agent — the Parallel Worker</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed m-0">A standalone AI entity that runs in its own context window to handle heavy, complex tasks — isolating large workloads so they don't clutter your main conversation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison table -->
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-6">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 bg-gray-50">
            <th class="text-left px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wide w-36">Feature</th>
            <th class="text-left px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wide">Plugin</th>
            <th class="text-left px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wide">Skill</th>
            <th class="text-left px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wide">Agent</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500">What it is</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-gray-700">A bundle/marketplace package of tools and instructions.</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-gray-700">A reusable instruction or domain-specific capability.</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-gray-700">A standalone AI persona or worker.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="bg-gray-50/50">
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500">Primary purpose</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-gray-700">Packaging and sharing capabilities across projects and teams.</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-gray-700">Automating specific, repeatable tasks within your active workflow.</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-gray-700">Executing complex, isolated, or parallel workflows.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500">Context</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-gray-700">Contains a mix of instructions, tools, and connectors.</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-gray-700">Loads on-demand within your current thread.</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-gray-700">Runs in its own dedicated context window.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <!-- When to use which -->
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700">When to use which</h3>
      <div class="flex gap-3 p-3 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg">
        <span class="text-base flex-shrink-0">🍳</span>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 m-0 mb-0.5">Build a Skill</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 m-0">When you need Claude to perform a specific, well-defined task repeatedly — like a PR review or code check — available dynamically in your current chat without starting a fresh session.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-3 p-3 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg">
        <span class="text-base flex-shrink-0">⚙️</span>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 m-0 mb-0.5">Use an Agent</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 m-0">When you need to delegate a long-running, multi-step task to the background — or need parallel processing, e.g. one agent managing the API layer while another explores the codebase.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-3 p-3 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg">
        <span class="text-base flex-shrink-0">📚</span>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 m-0 mb-0.5">Create a Plugin</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 m-0">When you want to bundle your custom skills, agents, and API keys so you can deploy your specialized configuration across different workspaces or share it on this marketplace.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Steps -->
  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-4">How to add a Skill</h2>
    <ol class="space-y-6 list-none p-0 m-0">

      <li class="flex gap-4">
        <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-plum-600 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">1</span>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Create a <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded">SKILL.md</code> in your repo</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">Place it in any of these locations — the scanner finds them all:</p>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded p-3 font-mono text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1">
            <p class="m-0">SKILL.md                          <span class="text-gray-400"># repo root</span></p>
            <p class="m-0">.claude/skills/my-skill/SKILL.md  <span class="text-gray-400"># Claude Code skills dir</span></p>
            <p class="m-0">.claude/commands/my-command.md    <span class="text-gray-400"># Claude Code commands</span></p>
            <p class="m-0">plugins/*/skills/*/SKILL.md       <span class="text-gray-400"># nested plugin structure</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="flex gap-4">
        <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-plum-600 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</span>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Add frontmatter at the top</p>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded p-3 font-mono text-xs text-gray-600">
            <p class="m-0 text-gray-400">---</p>
            <p class="m-0"><span class="text-plum-700">name</span>: My Skill Name</p>
            <p class="m-0"><span class="text-plum-700">description</span>: A one-line description shown on the card</p>
            <p class="m-0"><span class="text-plum-700">compatibility</span>: [claude-code, claude-chat]</p>
            <p class="m-0"><span class="text-plum-700">version</span>: 1.0.0</p>
            <p class="m-0"><span class="text-plum-700">sensitive_data</span>: false</p>
            <p class="m-0 text-gray-400">---</p>
            <p class="m-0 mt-2 text-gray-500"># Your skill content here...</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li class="flex gap-4">
        <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-plum-600 text-white text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</span>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Push to your repo — that's it</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">The registry re-scans every 4 hours. Your skill will appear in the marketplace after the next sync. The "last committer" shown on the card is whoever most recently pushed the file.</p>
        </div>
      </li>

    </ol>
  </section>

  <!-- Frontmatter reference -->
  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-4">Frontmatter fields</h2>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 bg-gray-50">
            <th class="text-left px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wide w-36">Field</th>
            <th class="text-left px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wide w-20">Required</th>
            <th class="text-left px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600 uppercase tracking-wide">Description</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-plum-700">name</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-500">Yes</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-600">Display name shown in the marketplace card and detail page.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-plum-700">description</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-500">Yes</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-600">One-line summary. Falls back to the first non-heading line of the file if omitted.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-plum-700">compatibility</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-500">No</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-600">Array of AI tools this skill works with: <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded">claude-code</code>, <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded">claude-chat</code>, <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded">claude-cowork</code>.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-plum-700">version</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-500">No</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-600">Semver string. Defaults to <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded">1.0.0</code>.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-plum-700">sensitive_data</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-500">No</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-gray-600">Set to <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded">true</code> if this skill works with PII or other sensitive data. Adds a ⚠ badge.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Agent section -->
  <section class="mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">For Agents</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">Agent config files are auto-detected — no special file naming needed beyond what your AI tool already expects:</p>
    <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded p-3 font-mono text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1">
      <p class="m-0">CLAUDE.md             <span class="text-gray-400"># Claude Code project instructions</span></p>
      <p class="m-0">.claude/agents/*.md   <span class="text-gray-400"># Claude Code sub-agents</span></p>
      <p class="m-0">.cursorrules          <span class="text-gray-400"># Cursor</span></p>
      <p class="m-0">.github/copilot-instructions.md  <span class="text-gray-400"># GitHub Copilot</span></p>
      <p class="m-0">GEMINI.md             <span class="text-gray-400"># Gemini CLI</span></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-6">
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Questions? Check the <a href="https://navasage.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/NH/pages/3137536013/FAQ+Claude+Skills" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-plum-600 hover:text-plum-700">FAQ</a> or drop by <a href="https://navasage.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CB/pages/3211788396/AI+Office+Hours" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-plum-600 hover:text-plum-700">AI Office Hours</a>.</p>
  </div>

</Base>
